UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (C): A C corporation is taxed at the entity level on its taxable income under IRC Section 11, and shareholders are taxed again when they receive dividends under Section 301(c). This double taxation is the defining disadvantage of the C corporation structure.
