UPDATE questions SET
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under IRC Section 704(b), special allocations that differ from ownership percentages are respected only if they have substantial economic effect. This requires that allocations affect capital accounts and be consistent with the partners'' economic arrangement under the regulations.
